the numbered lines of the example outline of a Tenant's covenants under the numbering of paragraphs inside a clause (a, i, A) is equal to list of Tenant's covenants, a	pay the Rent when due, b	keep the interior in good repair, b.i	fair wear and tear excepted, b.ii	damage by insured risks excepted and c	not assign or sublet without the Landlord's consent
the numbered lines of the example outline with an entry 2b outside the count under the usual numbering of legal paragraphs (1, A, i, a) is equal to list of Clauses, 1	Payment, 2b	Late payment and 2	Delivery
the numbered lines of the example outline with an entry 2b in place of the next number under the usual numbering of legal paragraphs (1, A, i, a) is equal to list of Clauses, 1	Payment, 2b	Late payment and 3	Delivery
the numbered lines of the example outline of recitals 1, 2, 7 and 8 under the usual numbering of legal paragraphs (1, A, i, a) is equal to list of Recitals, 1	Recital one, 2	Recital two, 7	Recital seven and 8	Recital eight
the numbered lines of the example outline of six defined terms under the numbering of paragraphs inside a clause (a, i, A) is equal to list of Definitions, a	Affiliate, b	Business Day, c	Confidential Information, d	Effective Date, e	Intellectual Property and f	Territory
